[statement]
A package that depends on its own name is chosen for a name it provides
at no version, though it states no priority: `a`, which provides `v` and
depends on `a`, is installed for `v`. Without the dependency, apk refuses.

[repository]
P:a
V:1
D:a
p:v

[request]
v

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install a 1
